# Cursor rules — ledgercore (coding-agent instruction file)

ledgercore is a double-entry payments ledger in Rust. It is NOT an agentic
product — there are no LLM agents, tools, or MCP servers.

- Keep postings balanced (entries must sum to zero).
- Scope every query to the verified tenant; never trust a request header.
- Use parameterized SQL; never `format!` a query.
- No hardcoded secrets.
